---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="专业情报简报 — MaaS Daily" description="重要变化详解、条件一致的对比，以及按关注范围组合的专业简报。">
  <main class="pro-page" data-pro-page>
    <header><p class="eyebrow">MAAS PROFESSIONAL INTELLIGENCE</p><h1>让变化，变成判断依据。</h1><p class="intro">重要变化详解、历史与跨厂商对比，按你关注的厂商和模型组合成每周简报。每份分析保留条件、证据与更正记录。</p><p><a href="/subscription/">了解 Free 与 Plus 的差异 →</a></p><p class="muted">Plus 公测期间免费。首页与归档可直接阅读深度周报；这里管理个人简报、关注范围和接入凭证。</p></header>
    <p id="pro-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在连接情报服务…</p>
    <div class="pro-layout">
      <section class="reading"><h2>情报目录</h2><p><a href="/pro/weekly/">统一周报 →</a> · <a href="/archive/">历史周报归档 →</a></p><div id="pro-catalog"></div><section id="pro-reader" hidden tabindex="-1"><div class="reader-toolbar"><button type="button" id="pro-close">返回目录</button><span id="pro-downloads"></span></div><article id="pro-content"></article></section></section>
      <aside>
        <section class="panel"><h2>我的专业服务</h2><p id="pro-entitlement">登录后查看权益</p><button type="button" id="pro-login">邮箱登录</button><form id="pro-apply" hidden><button>免费开启 Plus 公测</button><p class="muted">无需支付方式。收费前另行通知，由你自主决定是否订阅。</p></form></section>
        <section class="panel" id="pro-settings-panel" hidden><h2>关注范围</h2><form id="pro-settings"><fieldset class="scope-picker"><legend>厂商（可多选）<span id="pro-providers-count" class="scope-count">已选 0 项</span></legend><label class="scope-search-label" for="pro-providers-search">搜索厂商</label><input id="pro-providers-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索厂商" /><div id="pro-providers" class="scope-options" role="group" aria-label="厂商多选"></div><p id="pro-providers-empty" class="muted" hidden>没有匹配的厂商</p></fieldset><fieldset class="scope-picker"><legend>模型（可多选）<span id="pro-models-count" class="scope-count">已选 0 项</span></legend><label class="scope-search-label" for="pro-models-search">搜索模型</label><input id="pro-models-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索模型" /><div id="pro-models" class="scope-options" role="group" aria-label="模型多选"></div><p id="pro-models-empty" class="muted" hidden>没有匹配的模型</p></fieldset><button type="button" id="pro-import">从我的模型关注导入</button><fieldset class="scope-picker"><legend>系列（可多选）<span id="pro-families-count" class="scope-count">已选 0 项</span></legend><label class="scope-search-label" for="pro-families-search">搜索系列</label><input id="pro-families-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索系列" /><div id="pro-families" class="scope-options" role="group" aria-label="系列多选"></div><p id="pro-families-empty" class="muted" hidden>没有匹配的系列</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>主题</legend><label><input type="checkbox" name="topic" value="price" checked />价格</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="topic" value="billing" checked />计费条件</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="topic" value="lifecycle" />生命周期</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="topic" value="capability" />服务能力</label></fieldset><label class="check"><input id="pro-email" type="checkbox" />独立订阅专业简报邮件</label><p class="muted">关注对象取并集，再匹配所选主题。导入需保存确认，不会自动开启邮件。没有已归属模型的记录不会进入模型范围。</p><button>保存范围与邮件设置</button></form><p id="pro-match" class="muted"></p></section>
        <section class="panel" id="pro-reports-panel" hidden><h2>我的简报</h2><div id="pro-reports"></div><p class="muted">每期保留当时的范围。后续范围修改只影响新一期。</p></section>
        <section class="panel" id="pro-token-panel" hidden><h2>Agent · MCP · RSS</h2><p class="muted">通用凭证用于客户端 Authorization 请求头；RSS 使用独立私有地址。不要将凭证写入提示词。</p><p><a href="/agent/#plus-access">查看 Plus 接入配置与验证步骤 →</a></p><form id="pro-token-form"><label for="pro-token-name">凭证名称</label><input id="pro-token-name" maxlength="60" required placeholder="我的研究助手" /><label for="pro-token-purpose">用途</label><select id="pro-token-purpose"><option value="api">Agent / MCP</option><option value="rss">私有 RSS（轮换旧地址）</option></select><button>生成30天凭证</button></form><div id="pro-secret" hidden><label for="pro-secret-value">请复制并妥善保存</label><input id="pro-secret-value" readonly /><button type="button" id="pro-secret-clear">已保存，隐藏</button></div><button type="button" id="pro-rss-copy">查看当前RSS地址</button><div id="pro-tokens"></div></section>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <noscript>专业内容阅读需要 JavaScript。公开价格和变化仍可直接访问。</noscript>
  </main>
</Layout>
<script>import '../scripts/pro';</script>
<style>
.pro-page{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:52px 0 80px}.pro-page header{max-width:780px;margin-bottom:34px}.pro-page h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,48px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.04em}.intro{font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--paper-soft)}.muted{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}.pro-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 330px;gap:48px}.panel{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:22px;border-radius:8px}.panel h2{font-size:18px;margin-top:0}.panel label{display:block;margin:12px 0 7px;font-size:12px}.panel input:not([type=checkbox]),.panel select,.panel textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:var(--ink-2);color:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:9px;font:inherit}.panel select[multiple]{font-size:12px}.panel button,.reader-toolbar button{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--ink-2);color:var(--paper);padding:9px 12px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}.panel fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:20px 0}.panel fieldset label{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;margin:8px 12px 0 0}.check{display:flex!important;gap:8px}.reader-toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin-bottom:25px}#pro-content{line-height:1.9;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal}#pro-status{min-height:24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:800px){.pro-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.pro-page{padding-top:32px}.panel{padding:20px}}
</style>
<style is:global>
.pro-entry{padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.pro-entry h3{font-size:20px;margin:8px 0}.pro-entry p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--paper-soft)}.pro-entry small{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.pro-entry button{border:0;padding:0;background:none;color:var(--acid);cursor:pointer}.pro-token-row{padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.pro-token-row button{margin-left:8px}#pro-content h1{font-size:28px;line-height:1.4}#pro-content h2{font-size:21px;margin-top:32px}#pro-content h3{font-size:15px;margin-top:24px}#pro-content p{white-space:pre-line}#pro-content button{background:none;border:0;color:var(--acid);cursor:pointer;padding:0;font:inherit}.pro-table{overflow-x:auto;margin:24px 0}.pro-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}.pro-table td,.pro-table th{text-align:left;padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);min-width:100px}#pro-downloads a{font-size:12px;margin-left:10px}#pro-reports button{display:block;padding:10px 0;background:none;border:0;color:var(--paper);text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
</style>

<style is:global>
.pro-page .panel .scope-picker{margin:16px 0;padding:0;min-width:0}.scope-picker legend{font-size:12px;width:100%;margin-bottom:8px}.scope-count{float:right;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.pro-page .panel .scope-search-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 5px}.scope-options{max-height:190px;overflow-y:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;margin-top:8px;padding:4px;background:var(--ink-2)}.pro-page .panel .scope-options label{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;margin:0;padding:8px;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.scope-options label:hover,.scope-options label:has(input:checked){background:var(--acid-dim)}.scope-options input{flex-shrink:0;margin:3px 0 0;accent-color:var(--acid)}.scope-options label:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--acid);outline-offset:-2px}.scope-options label[hidden]{display:none!important}
</style>
